- A server without Fabric API gets the newest one for its Minecraft version from Modrinth before it starts (with "Install and update the Nice Control Center mod" on); one already there is left alone
- Profile pictures (Account → Profile & look, also in the navbar and the users list) and eight themes to pick from (Dark, Light, Midnight, Forest, Nether, The End, Ocean, Sakura), saved with the account so they follow you to every device
